[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-ACCOUNT-MANAGEMENT
TITLE: Account Management

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-CLEAR-PASSWORDS
TITLE: /users/{cuid}/clear-passwords

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-263
TITLE: Clear Past Passwords
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL delete the past password hashes for the user identified by cuid through the clear-passwords transaction.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A user moderator clears retained past password hashes for a member without changing that member's current password hash.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-35
GSSC5-36
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-264
TITLE: Clear Past Passwords Login Token Required
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL forbid a clear-passwords request when the request lacks a valid Login Token in the HTTP cookie, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Only a logged-in caller may clear past password hashes.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-35, GSSC5-48
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-265
TITLE: Clear Past Passwords Privilege
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL complete a clear-passwords request when the Login Token in the HTTP cookie belongs to a caller who is a user moderator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Clearing past password hashes is limited to a user moderator.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-35
GSSC5-36
GSSC5-48
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-266
TITLE: Clear Past Passwords Forbidden
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL forbid a clear-passwords request when the caller is not a user moderator, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller who is not a user moderator cannot clear past password hashes.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-35
GSSC5-36
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-267
TITLE: Clear Past Passwords User Not Found
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL report not found for a clear-passwords request when the cuid matches no user, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Clearing past password hashes requires a known user cuid.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-35
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

