STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL return the Username in each user list entry when the caller is the user in that entry, or the caller is a user moderator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The user and a user moderator receive this field. No high-level requirement grants that view to a user moderator, so the moderator grant is derived.
