TITLE: User List Home Address line 3
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL return the Home Address line 3 in each user list entry when the caller is the user in that entry, or the caller is a user moderator. The user list also returns the Home Address line 3 to another logged-in member when that user's Home Address display is full.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The user and a user moderator receive this Home Address part. Another member receives it when the Home Address display is full. The moderator grant is derived.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-34
GSSC5-36
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-34
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-58
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-78
  ROLE: Refines

