[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-125
TITLE: User List Hidden Filter Match
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL treat a value omitted from that caller's view of that user as a filter match only when the caller is a user moderator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A hidden value matches a filter for a caller who is a user moderator. For every other caller, a hidden value is not a match.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-34
GSSC5-36
<<<
