[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-USER-LIST-FAILURES
TITLE: Failure Cases

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-42
TITLE: User List Missing Login Token
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL forbid the user list when the Login Token in the HTTP cookie is missing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A missing Login Token is not a current login. The failure does not say which check failed.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34, GSSC5-48
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-21
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-67
