UID: GSSC-BLLR-140
TITLE: User Read Username
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL return the Username of the user identified by the cuid when the caller is that user, or the caller is a user moderator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The user and a user moderator receive this field. No high-level requirement grants that view to a user moderator, so the moderator grant is derived.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-34
GSSC5-36
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-141
TITLE: User Read Primary Email
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL return the Primary Email of the user identified by the cuid when the caller is that user, or the caller is a user moderator. The user read also returns the Primary Email to another logged-in member when that user's Preferred Contact Method is Email or None.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The user and a user moderator receive the Primary Email. Another member receives it when the Preferred Contact Method is Email or None. The moderator grant is derived.
<<<
