[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-USER-POST-DATA
TITLE: Data Updated

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-58
TITLE: Administrator User Update
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL apply the user update when the caller is an administrator, including when the cuid is that caller's own cuid.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An administrator can update any user, including that administrator's own record.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-60
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-169
TITLE: Own User Update
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL apply the user update when the cuid is the caller's own cuid and that user is not an administrator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A member who is not an administrator can update that member's own account.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-36
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-170
TITLE: User Moderator User Update
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL apply the user update when the caller is a user moderator and the user identified by the cuid is not an administrator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A user moderator can update a user who is not an administrator. No high-level requirement grants that update.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-172
TITLE: User Update Omitted Fields
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL leave every omitted account field unchanged when the user update is stored.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The update changes the fields included in the request. Every field left out of the request stays as stored.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-174
TITLE: User Update First Name
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a posted First Name when the caller is an administrator, when the cuid is the caller's own cuid and that user is not an administrator, or when the caller is a user moderator and the user identified by the cuid is not an administrator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The member can change this field on that member's own account, and an administrator can change it for any user. A user moderator can change it for a user who is not an administrator. No high-level requirement grants that moderator update.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-36
  ROLE: Refines
