UID: GSSC-BLLR-65
TITLE: Username Update
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a posted Username when the caller is an administrator, when the cuid is the caller's own cuid and that user is not an administrator, or when the caller is a user moderator and the user identified by the cuid is not an administrator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The current member, a user moderator, and an administrator can change the Username of a user they are allowed to update. No high-level requirement says a member can change it.
<<<
