[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-66
TITLE: Membership Status Update
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a posted Membership Status when the caller is not the user identified by the cuid and the caller is an administrator. The user update also stores that status when the caller is a user moderator and that user is not an administrator. An authorized caller clears Membership Status with "".
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An administrator can change another user's Membership Status. A user moderator can change it for a user who is not the caller and who is not an administrator. No high-level requirement says who may change Membership Status. The status values remain unnamed.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-279
TITLE: Administrator Position Update
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a posted Position when the caller is an administrator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An administrator can set any member's Position, including that administrator's own Position.
<<<
