RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-86
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-281
TITLE: Position Clear
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL clear the stored Position when an authorized caller posts Position as "".
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An empty Position clears the stored value and removes that member from the leadership list.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-36
