[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-218
TITLE: Username Empty
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL invalidate the user update when an included Username is "", and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Every user has a Username. An empty Username invalidates the update, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-219
TITLE: Username Already Stored
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL invalidate the user update when the posted Username is already stored for another user, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Each Username belongs to one user. An update that would give a second user that Username is invalidated, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-63
TITLE: Primary Email Still Unique
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL invalidate the user update when the posted Primary Email is already stored for another user. The backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Each Primary Email belongs to one user. An update that would give a second user that Primary Email is invalidated, and the stored values stay as they are.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-101
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-221
TITLE: Permission Update Forbidden
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL forbid the user update when the caller is not an administrator and the request includes is administrator, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller who is not an administrator is forbidden from changing is administrator, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
