  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-222
TITLE: User is user moderator Update Forbidden
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL forbid the user update when the caller is not an administrator and the request includes is user moderator, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller who is not an administrator is forbidden from changing is user moderator, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
DERIVED: False
