[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-KVS-POST
TITLE: POST Key

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-296
TITLE: Key-Value Entry Upsert
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL create or replace the key-value entry for the key in the path when an administrator authenticated by the Login Token HTTP cookie supplies a value in the request body.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An administrator creates a new entry or replaces the value of an existing entry. The Login Token is taken from the HTTP cookie.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-43
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-181
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-297
TITLE: Key-Value Upsert Login Token Required
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL forbid a key-value upsert when the Login Token HTTP cookie is missing or is not a valid Login Token, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Only a logged-in administrator may create or replace a key-value entry. The Login Token is taken from the HTTP cookie.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-43
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-181
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-298
TITLE: Key-Value Upsert Privilege
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL complete a key-value upsert when the Login Token from the HTTP cookie belongs to a caller who is an administrator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Creating or replacing a key-value entry is limited to an administrator. The Login Token is taken from the HTTP cookie.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-43
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-181
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-299
TITLE: Key-Value Upsert Forbidden
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL forbid a key-value upsert when the caller is not an administrator, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller who is not an administrator cannot create or replace a key-value entry.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-43
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-181
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-300
TITLE: Key-Value Upsert Value Required
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL invalidate a key-value upsert when the request omits a string value, and the backend writes nothing.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A key-value upsert requires a string value for that key.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-43
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

