VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-37
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-135
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-323
TITLE: Section List Index Order
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL order section list results by index ascending.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Index determines order among page data entries that share a page; list order follows that index.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-37
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-187
