UID: GSSC-BLLR-327
TITLE: Section List Filters
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL accept section-list query filters for header, body, tag, cuid, and content, matching header, body, tag, and content as a case-insensitive substring, matching content against the header or the body, and matching cuid exactly.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Filter keys and match rules refine the high-level filter requirement.
<<<
