The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL create a section from a template for a logged-in member who has create permission on that template, requiring a body and a template cuid, accepting optional header, resources, tags, and index, storing isPublic and permission values from the template, and storing tags as the template tags plus the requested tags.
