- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-116
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-32
TITLE: Secondary Email Display
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store whether a user's Secondary Email is displayed. The other-member view includes the Secondary Email when the user has chosen to display it and the Preferred Contact Method is Email or None.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The account holds the member's choice to display the Secondary Email when one is provided. That choice puts the Secondary Email in the other-member view when the Preferred Contact Method is Email or None.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-115
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-33
TITLE: User Preferred Contact Method
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a Preferred Contact Method for a user in the users table. The stored value is Email, Phone, or None. For a user other than the permanent admin, the Preferred Contact Method is present. The other-member view includes the Primary Email when the Preferred Contact Method is Email or None, and the Primary Phone Number when the Preferred Contact Method is Phone or None. An absent value provides no Primary Email and no Primary Phone Number in the other-member view.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The account holds the Preferred Contact Method that the member can view and modify. The allowed values are Email, Phone, or None. Email shows the Primary Email, Phone shows the Primary Phone Number, and None shows both. The permanent admin account may omit it. An absent value gives the other-member view neither primary contact.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-106
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-11
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-34
TITLE: User Home Address
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a Home Address for a user in the users table as line 1, line 2, line 3, city, state, zip code, and zip extension. Line 1, city, state, and zip code are non-empty for a user other than the permanent admin. Line 2, line 3, and zip extension may be absent. The zip code is five digits. The zip extension, when present, is four digits. The permanent admin may omit the Home Address.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The account holds the Home Address that the member can view and modify. Line 1, city, state, and the five-digit zip code are the required parts. Line 2, line 3, and the four-digit zip extension may be absent. The permanent admin account may omit the Home Address.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-107
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-35
TITLE: Home Address Display
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store whether a user's Home Address is displayed in full or redacted. An absent choice, and a redacted choice, show the city and the state in the other-member view. A full choice shows the stored Home Address.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The account holds the Home Address display that the member or an administrator can set. Redacted shows the city and the state. An absent choice is treated as redacted. A full choice shows the stored Home Address.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-117
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-12
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-36
TITLE: User Mailing Address
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a Mailing Address for a user in the users table in the same shape as the Home Address. Line 1, city, state, and zip code are non-empty for a user other than the permanent admin. Line 2, line 3, and zip extension may be absent. The zip code is five digits. The zip extension, when present, is four digits. The permanent admin may omit the Mailing Address. The Mailing Address has no view type.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The account holds the Mailing Address that the member can view and modify. It uses the same parts as the Home Address. The Mailing Address has no full-or-redacted view type.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-108
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-37
TITLE: User is administrator
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store is administrator for each user in the users table. is administrator is true or false. A user created before this column exists stores false unless that user is the permanent admin account created or updated by GSSC-BLLR-40.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
is administrator is the stored site privilege that makes a user an administrator. Existing users store false. The permanent admin account is set true by GSSC-BLLR-40.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-111
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-38
TITLE: User is user moderator
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store is user moderator for each user in the users table. is user moderator is true or false. A user created before this column exists stores false.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
is user moderator is a stored site privilege. It is not the administrator privilege. Existing users store false.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-111
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-344
TITLE: User is tool editor
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store is tool editor for each user in the users table. is tool editor is true or false. A user created before this column exists stores false.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
is tool editor is a stored site privilege that authorizes research tool catalog changes. Existing users store false.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-18
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-111
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-353
TITLE: Administrator Sets Tool Editor
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let an administrator set is tool editor true or false on a member account.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Administrators assign the tool editor privilege so authorized members can maintain the research tools catalog.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-18
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-111
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-64
TITLE: User Membership Status
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a Membership Status for a user in the users table. The Membership Status may be absent. This requirement does not name the status values.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The account holds the member's Membership Status. The status may be absent. The allowed status values remain unnamed.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-114
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-275
TITLE: User Position
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a Position for a user in the users table. The Position may be absent. Empty is the default.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Each user record can hold a Position. Empty is the default until Position is set. A populated Position is the member's leadership role. This requirement does not name the positions.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-36
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-110
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-276
TITLE: User Account Photo
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store an Account Photo for a user in the users table. The Account Photo may be absent.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Each user record can hold an Account Photo. The Account Photo may be absent. This requirement does not define the form of the photo or provide upload.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-36
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-109
  ROLE: Refines

