[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-PAGE-DATA-STORAGE
TITLE: Generic Content

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-338
TITLE: Page Entry Table
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store sections, announcements, and event details as rows in a page data table with a datatype, optional header, body, resources, tags, index, isPublic flag, create permission, modify permission, delete permission, and optional template reference.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
One table holds the three page data entry kinds with shared metadata including index and tags.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-37
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-185
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-339
TITLE: Page Entry Index
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store an integer index on each page data table entry for sections, announcements, and event details.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Index is unified across entry kinds that share a page.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-37
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-187
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-340
TITLE: Content Template Table
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store each content template with a name, isPublic flag, tags, create permission, modify permission, and delete permission.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Content templates persist the defaults applied when creating page data entries that use them.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-37
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-186
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BLLR-342
TITLE: Content Permission Bit Fields
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL interpret each non-administrator create, modify, and delete permission integer with bit 0 set for a regular member and bit 1 set for a user moderator.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Permission integers on page data entries and content templates encode which non-administrator roles may create, modify, or delete.
<<<
DERIVED: True
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-37
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-BHLR-185
  ROLE: Refines

